      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F56E070BA00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B9398DB592987B387825B7867034E86505A9020578BFF0C000A62404EE5621166F45E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD53BB63116230FF0100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正如卡洛斯地區有寶可夢聯盟！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B63598253616D1B65AF5730534067095BF653EF5922806F76DFFF0100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市有多麗米亞聯盟！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E026709591A9E977C734E9E806F76DFFF0100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而所謂的多麗米亞聯盟，\n就是萬中選一的多麗米亞行家們<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n相競誰的多麗米亞更強的聯盟。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C62408B027684591A9E977C734E9E806F76DFFF0C000A5C31662F842C4E2D90784E007684591A9E977C734E9E884C5BB6501100100001BE00000A76F87AF68AB07684591A9E977C734E9E66F45F377684806F76DF300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "並且有被稱為四天王的\n4位訓練家等待著挑戰者。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E264E14670988AB7A3170BA56DB5929738B7684000A00344F4D8A137DF45BB67B495F858457631162308005300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "四天王分散在\n密阿雷的4家餐廳。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DB5929738B520665635728000A5BC6963F96F7768400345BB699105EF3300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳想要挑戰四天王的話，\n請將同行隊伍調整成只有多麗米亞。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B360F389816311623056DB5929738B76848A71FF0C000A8ACB5C07540C884C968A4F0D8ABF6574621053EA6709591A9E977C734E9E300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有興趣，就去戰勝所有的\n多麗米亞聯盟四天王吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3670982088DA3FF0C5C3153BB623052DD624067097684000A591A9E977C734E9E806F76DF56DB5929738B5427FF0100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
