      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我們一決高下，看是哪個造型\n最能凸顯多麗米亞的魅力吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
