      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00540000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "現在……在密阿雷中\n愛多麗米亞愛得最深的人，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，非<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳莫屬！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 5140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73FE57282026202657285BC6963F96F74E2D000A611B591A9E977C734E9E611B5F9767006DF176844EBAFF0C00100001BE00000A5C31662F0010000201000000FF0C975E00100003110000FF01014F6059B383AB5C6CFF0100100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恭喜<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n多麗米亞冠軍！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 5240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "606D559C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A591A9E977C734E9E51A08ECDFF0100100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恭喜。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 5288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "606D559C300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "照欣，終於回到以前那樣了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 5304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71676B23FF0C7D4265BC56DE52304EE5524D90A36A234E865462300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊……5年前發生的事件使得\n幫多麗米亞做造型的寶可美容沙龍館<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就這麼關門了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 5344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554A2026202600355E74524D767C751F76844E8B4EF64F7F5F97000A5E6B591A9E977C734E9E505A9020578B76845BF653EF7F8E5BB96C999F8D992800100001BE00000A5C3190199EBC95DC95804E86300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當時，密阿雷的多麗米亞愛好者們\n無一不感到心碎。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n一度認為我們從此就無法再為\n心愛的多麗米亞改變造型了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 5440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75766642FF0C5BC6963F96F77684591A9E977C734E9E611B597D80055011000A71214E004E0D611F52305FC3788E300200100001BE01000A4E005EA68A8D70BA621150115F9E6B645C3171216CD5518D70BA000A5FC3611B7684591A9E977C734E9E65398B8A9020578B4E86300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但救世主卻在此時出現了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 5560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4665514E164E3B537B57286B64664251FA73FE4E86300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 5596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B35594300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "若是只有秀簡和飛天螳螂，\n想必至今還是難以幫多麗米亞做造型。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 5632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82E5662F53EA670979C07C21548C98DB592987B38782FF0C000A60F35FC581F34ECA9084662F96E34EE55E6B591A9E977C734E9E505A9020578B300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳卻不著痕跡地讓他們學會了技術，\n自己還登上了多麗米亞聯盟的頂端！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 5704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B3537B4E0D845775D58DE157308B934ED650115B7867034E8662808853FF0C000A81EA5DF19084767B4E0A4E86591A9E977C734E9E806F76DF768498027AEFFF0100100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的英姿而深受感動的人們\n想必也會紛紛仿效多麗米亞聯盟，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n從此創建粉蝶蛹聯盟、龜腳腳聯盟之類的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 5796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E000100003110000FF01014F6059B3768482F159FF800C6DF153D7611F52D576844EBA5011000A60F35FC54E5F67037D1B7D1B4EFF6548591A9E977C734E9E806F76DFFF0C00100001BE01000A5F9E6B6452755EFA7C89877686F9806F76DF30019F9C81738173806F76DF4E4B985E7684FF0100100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在所有的單一寶可夢聯盟，\n都展現出<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳對寶可夢的愛吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 5924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3572862406709768455AE4E005BF653EF5922806F76DFFF0C000A90FD5C5573FE51FA00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C0D5BF653EF59227684611B5427300200100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然話題變得有點奇怪了，\n但今後也請多幫多麗米亞做造型喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
